WEBVTT

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.232
[This drama is a work of fiction]

00:00:07.232 --> 00:00:09.064
[All scenes involving animals and children were filmed in compliance with regulations]

00:00:09.064 --> 00:00:16.480
[The Day of the Incident, March 30, 10:10 PM]

00:00:20.744 --> 00:00:23.111
Think.

00:00:23.111 --> 00:00:24.816
Just stay calm.

00:00:26.508 --> 00:00:28.612
What do I do?

00:00:28.612 --> 00:00:31.180
I just need to stay calm.

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.476
No...

00:00:33.476 --> 00:00:35.504
No, you idiot, think!

00:00:35.504 --> 00:00:37.816
What do I do? How am I supposed to fix this?

00:00:38.608 --> 00:00:41.549
Come on, think. Think. What do I do?

00:00:41.549 --> 00:00:42.864
How...

00:00:42.864 --> 00:00:45.216
How do I...

00:00:46.408 --> 00:00:48.749
Just stay calm. What do I do?

00:01:33.949 --> 00:01:37.216
[Do]

00:01:39.483 --> 00:01:40.616
[Missed Call, Do]

00:01:40.616 --> 00:01:42.949
[Draw the unlock pattern]

00:01:42.949 --> 00:01:44.783
[Pattern entered incorrectly]

00:02:05.248 --> 00:02:07.016
Is this a dream?

00:02:08.568 --> 00:02:10.349
It's a nightmare.

00:02:14.908 --> 00:02:16.683
This is driving me crazy.

00:02:18.408 --> 00:02:20.383
I'm screwed!

00:02:21.688 --> 00:02:23.388
Shoot...

00:03:03.728 --> 00:03:07.216
Shoot! Where did it go?

00:03:13.472 --> 00:03:15.316
What is this?

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:28.749
Darn it...

00:04:42.196 --> 00:04:44.964
<i>- Hello?</i> - Hey, bro!

00:04:44.964 --> 00:04:47.016
How have you been? It's me.

00:04:47.016 --> 00:04:49.044
<i>I told you not to contact me.</i>

00:04:49.044 --> 00:04:50.483
<i>And what's with this number?</i>

00:04:50.483 --> 00:04:53.180
This phone can't be traced, so don't worry.

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:54.536
It's nothing,

00:04:54.536 --> 00:04:57.108
But I lost my phone.

00:04:57.108 --> 00:04:58.583
<i>So?</i>

00:04:58.583 --> 00:05:01.204
You know how much important stuff I had on there.

00:05:01.204 --> 00:05:05.488
I need to find the hit-and-run vehicle, and I need to find it fast.

00:05:05.488 --> 00:05:07.128
Can you run a search on the vehicle?

00:05:07.128 --> 00:05:09.028
<i>Jeez, why do you keep doing this, seriously?</i>

00:05:09.028 --> 00:05:11.776
Come on, just help me out this once, okay?

00:05:11.776 --> 00:05:12.820
<i>What's the plate number?</i>

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:14.548
I don't know that,

00:05:14.548 --> 00:05:17.992
But the car was damaged, so it would go to a repair shop.

00:05:17.992 --> 00:05:19.968
Can you pull the repair records?

00:05:19.968 --> 00:05:22.916
<i>How am I supposed to do that? It's illegal.</i>

00:05:27.628 --> 00:05:29.916
Listen,

00:05:29.916 --> 00:05:31.883
If what's on that phone gets exposed,

00:05:32.796 --> 00:05:34.836
You won't exactly come out clean either, right?

00:05:34.836 --> 00:05:37.632
<i>Darn it, are you threatening me?</i>

00:05:37.632 --> 00:05:39.332
Yeah.

00:05:40.483 --> 00:05:42.316
So help me out.

00:05:52.516 --> 00:05:58.116
[Episode 5, Business Relationship]

00:06:00.416 --> 00:06:03.049
Jeez, why isn't he reading it?

00:06:13.048 --> 00:06:15.752
Min Seo, why don't you go upstairs?

00:06:15.752 --> 00:06:17.652
Go up.

00:06:17.652 --> 00:06:19.352
Hurry.

00:06:24.912 --> 00:06:27.736
Jeez...

00:06:27.736 --> 00:06:30.100
Min Seo! Min Seo?

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.708
Min Seo!

00:06:31.708 --> 00:06:35.256
Can you call Ye Ji and ask if her parents are home?

00:06:35.256 --> 00:06:36.956
Right now.

00:06:57.512 --> 00:07:00.268
But seriously, what's going on?

00:07:00.268 --> 00:07:03.649
Why? Did something happen?

00:07:09.692 --> 00:07:12.249
She said they haven't come home yet.

00:07:13.064 --> 00:07:14.988
But why do you...

00:07:14.988 --> 00:07:17.483
Never mind, Min Seo. Go back to your room now.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:25.683
Honey! Honey!

00:08:35.988 --> 00:08:37.952
Are you okay?

00:08:37.952 --> 00:08:40.384
Director Ahn, are you alright?

00:08:40.384 --> 00:08:42.408
I didn't know you were there.

00:08:42.408 --> 00:08:45.683
It's always darkest right under the lamp.

00:08:50.396 --> 00:08:52.492
What's gotten into her, seriously?

00:08:52.492 --> 00:08:55.704
- Jeez! - Hey, listen,

00:08:55.704 --> 00:08:59.183
Could you tell me where you spent the money you borrowed today?

00:09:10.508 --> 00:09:12.516
You punk.

00:09:13.284 --> 00:09:15.728
- What? - I'm just worried about you, Jae Hong.

00:09:15.728 --> 00:09:17.720
Maybe I can help.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:19.736
You said you wouldn't hide anything from me.

00:09:19.736 --> 00:09:23.149
Oh, come on. I'm not hiding anything. Seriously.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:30.052
- Yeah, Director, take care. - Oh...

00:09:30.052 --> 00:09:31.960
You two

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.983
Must have something important to discuss, huh?

00:09:33.983 --> 00:09:37.149
- There's nothing we need to discuss... - Oh, yes. It's about promoting my clinic.

00:09:38.992 --> 00:09:41.349
- Let's discuss that tomorrow. - It'll only take a minute.

00:09:45.972 --> 00:09:48.632
Then come inside and we can talk together.

00:09:48.632 --> 00:09:51.983
Oh, we can just talk here for a...

00:09:56.584 --> 00:10:00.216
Why go inside now, honey?

00:10:00.216 --> 00:10:03.116
We can talk about it later.

00:10:18.416 --> 00:10:20.916
[Can the passenger in a car accident also be punished?]

00:10:20.916 --> 00:10:23.049
[Incoming Call]

00:10:27.528 --> 00:10:29.000
Yeah, Min Seo.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:30.632
<i>Hey, Ye Ji.</i>

00:10:30.632 --> 00:10:31.696
<i>Something terrible happened!</i>

00:10:31.696 --> 00:10:35.892
<i>Y-Your mom tried to hit my mom with her car.</i>

00:10:35.892 --> 00:10:39.249
- What? - <i>I think my mom told them everything.</i>

00:10:56.276 --> 00:10:58.683
You haven't been sleeping well lately, have you?

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:06.884
Looks like Ye Ji still isn't home.

00:11:06.884 --> 00:11:09.483
The house feels very empty, huh?

00:11:28.172 --> 00:11:30.616
Just focus on promoting your clinic.

00:11:31.456 --> 00:11:33.720
You must be enjoying it, Director,

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:35.449
Since you're so free.

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:40.080
I've been busting my chops all day

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:43.283
Trying to come up with the money.

00:11:46.836 --> 00:11:48.916
Because of this video.

00:11:53.648 --> 00:11:56.468
Honey, what are you talking about all of a sudden?

00:11:56.468 --> 00:11:58.383
What's this?

00:12:00.712 --> 00:12:03.552
Kyung Hee hasn't been feeling well since earlier,

00:12:03.552 --> 00:12:05.254
So I think you should head home for today.

00:12:05.254 --> 00:12:08.504
Was that 100 million won earlier because of this?

00:12:08.504 --> 00:12:09.948
What?

00:12:09.948 --> 00:12:11.648
100 million won?

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:16.888
Uh, no...

00:12:16.888 --> 00:12:19.583
I mean, it wasn't 100 million won.

00:12:20.924 --> 00:12:22.588
It was 99 million won.

00:12:22.588 --> 00:12:24.288
Yeah.

00:12:35.948 --> 00:12:38.583
So that 100 million won you were taking credit for

00:12:39.188 --> 00:12:41.508
Was her money?

00:12:41.508 --> 00:12:44.183
What? Me?

00:12:44.916 --> 00:12:46.912
Oh!

00:12:46.912 --> 00:12:51.432
Did I not mention that I borrowed this from her?

00:12:51.432 --> 00:12:53.480
Oh, right.

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:56.249
Honey, and it wasn't 100 million won,

00:12:57.516 --> 00:12:59.416
It was 99 million.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.216
Well, that's convenient.

00:13:10.204 --> 00:13:12.532
Since the total is 500 million won,

00:13:12.532 --> 00:13:15.680
Split it half and half, so 150 million...

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:19.116
You'll need to put in another 151 million.

00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:22.312
- What are you talking about now? - Why would you split it...

00:13:22.312 --> 00:13:24.104
Why?

00:13:24.104 --> 00:13:27.349
Because both faces were clearly caught on camera!

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:37.983
[Lim Ye Ji: Is something wrong? There's a video showing our faces]

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:10.832
Both of them?

00:14:10.832 --> 00:14:14.156
Wait, if they're clearly visible...

00:14:14.156 --> 00:14:16.100
Oh, no!

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:18.649
You mean the kids' faces were all captured?

00:14:20.832 --> 00:14:23.624
Kids?

00:14:23.624 --> 00:14:24.624
Oh, no...

00:14:24.624 --> 00:14:28.340
But it was dark there, and there weren't even any CCTV cameras. How...

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:30.948
And the car windows were heavily tinted, weren't they?

00:14:30.948 --> 00:14:35.372
Then how... how could the kids' faces have been captured?

00:14:35.372 --> 00:14:39.032
Wait. What is she talking about, honey?

00:14:39.032 --> 00:14:40.776
Is she saying Min Seo was there too?

00:14:40.776 --> 00:14:43.483
Wait, hold on!

00:14:57.027 --> 00:14:59.156
Why? I need to see it too.

00:14:59.156 --> 00:15:00.650
Okay, honey. Let's check this

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:01.968
- first, alright? - We're in big trouble!

00:15:01.968 --> 00:15:04.368
I think the police came to arrest Min Seo!

00:15:04.368 --> 00:15:06.276
- The police? The... - The police? Why the police?

00:15:06.276 --> 00:15:08.148
The police are here?

00:15:08.148 --> 00:15:10.092
- They really are. - Are they here just for Min Seo?

00:15:10.092 --> 00:15:12.241
Did you two do this?

00:15:12.241 --> 00:15:14.783
Why would we call the police?

00:15:15.540 --> 00:15:16.883
Min Seo? Oh, Min Seo.

00:15:16.883 --> 00:15:18.960
Min... Min Seo, Mom's coming.

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:22.620
Don't open the door. Just wait for me, okay?

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:24.416
Darn it.

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:33.949
Hey, Lim Ye Ji! Come here.

00:15:36.364 --> 00:15:37.996
Ye Ji,

00:15:37.996 --> 00:15:41.222
What is this about Min Seo?

00:15:41.222 --> 00:15:43.012
You said you were alone.

00:15:43.012 --> 00:15:44.960
Lim Ye Ji?

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.660
Tell me.

00:15:47.484 --> 00:15:49.936
Were you the one driving?

00:15:49.936 --> 00:15:52.383
Why did the police come for Min Seo?

00:15:55.112 --> 00:15:57.583
So you weren't even the one driving?

00:15:58.628 --> 00:16:02.068
But last night, you... We were...

00:16:02.068 --> 00:16:05.626
Why did we go through all that trouble, seriously!

00:16:05.626 --> 00:16:09.116
Why on earth did you lie?

00:16:09.116 --> 00:16:10.724
Ye Ji!

00:16:10.724 --> 00:16:13.704
Did Min Seo tell you to lie?

00:16:13.704 --> 00:16:15.949
Does Min Seo have something on you?

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:21.216
Then tell the truth.

00:16:24.268 --> 00:16:28.216
You were just a passenger.

00:16:29.064 --> 00:16:31.140
You were so shocked that you just came home,

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:35.892
And you tell them Min Seo was the only one driving.

00:16:35.892 --> 00:16:37.592
Do you understand?

00:16:41.704 --> 00:16:44.056
I said, do you understand?

00:16:44.056 --> 00:16:45.756
Yeah.

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:52.352
So what exactly was the report about?

00:16:52.352 --> 00:16:54.660
Do you have your ID with you?

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:57.516
- We need to verify your identity first. - Hey, wait, wait.

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:01.872
She's Joo Min Seo's mother.

00:17:01.872 --> 00:17:05.264
Where is Min Seo now?

00:17:05.264 --> 00:17:08.352
What about Min Seo? Is something wrong?

00:17:10.055 --> 00:17:11.712
Well, Mr. Joo Bo Sung...

00:17:11.712 --> 00:17:16.084
Her father filed a missing person report for Min Seo.

00:17:16.084 --> 00:17:18.183
You didn't know?

00:17:20.124 --> 00:17:21.824
Oh!

00:17:26.972 --> 00:17:29.204
Joo Bo Sung!

00:17:29.204 --> 00:17:31.488
Min Seo! Are you okay?

00:17:31.488 --> 00:17:33.792
I'm just glad it wasn't anything serious.

00:17:33.792 --> 00:17:35.436
Yeah.

00:17:35.436 --> 00:17:37.440
I was so worried about you.

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:39.140
I'm fine.

00:17:39.744 --> 00:17:41.844
- What on earth is that? - Must be hard.

00:17:41.844 --> 00:17:44.283
I thought you were going to get arrested.

00:17:48.248 --> 00:17:50.349
You guys wouldn't happen to...

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:55.683
- Dad! - Stay right there, Lim Ye Ji.

00:18:00.349 --> 00:18:03.616
[Calling]

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:15.660
Lim Ye Ji!

00:18:16.264 --> 00:18:19.172
Is Min Seo your 'boyfriend'?

00:18:19.172 --> 00:18:21.740
What are you talking about?

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:24.116
Why would Min Seo be Ye Ji's boyfriend?

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:31.900
- Ye Ji? - Is that why you lied to us? Huh?

00:18:32.656 --> 00:18:36.716
So you took someone else's kid's screw-up

00:18:36.716 --> 00:18:39.972
And made your mom and dad clean up the whole mess?

00:18:39.972 --> 00:18:41.672
Huh?

00:18:43.256 --> 00:18:44.256
I'm sorry.

00:18:44.256 --> 00:18:47.449
Oh, for God's sake.

00:18:53.049 --> 00:18:56.049
Ye Ji, after everything your mom and dad went through yesterday, you...

00:19:00.556 --> 00:19:02.564
Lim Ye Ji!

00:19:02.564 --> 00:19:04.148
Come inside.

00:19:04.148 --> 00:19:05.949
Let's talk inside.

00:19:08.316 --> 00:19:10.592
By the way...

00:19:10.592 --> 00:19:14.649
Well... about that video you mentioned earlier.

00:19:17.592 --> 00:19:21.449
The part about the kids' faces being caught on it, that was a lie, wasn't it?

00:19:22.876 --> 00:19:25.284
What are you talking about? What do you mean, a lie?

00:19:25.284 --> 00:19:28.920
Until just now, you didn't even know Min Seo was there with her, did you?

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:30.816
If Min Seo's face was on the video,

00:19:30.816 --> 00:19:34.864
You wouldn't have been fooled by Ye Ji's lie.

00:19:34.864 --> 00:19:36.784
- That's... - Exactly.

00:19:36.784 --> 00:19:38.849
Then what was actually caught on the video?

00:19:43.216 --> 00:19:47.916
So Min Seo wasn't in the video in the first place, was she?

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:56.383
Interesting, Ms. Ahn Soo Jung.

00:19:58.036 --> 00:20:00.049
What, wanna see?

00:20:07.112 --> 00:20:09.216
How did it get caught on camera?

00:20:10.332 --> 00:20:13.883
Wait, who else was there besides us?

00:20:14.952 --> 00:20:18.283
Could someone else have been there?

00:20:20.472 --> 00:20:22.183
I don't know.

00:20:23.956 --> 00:20:28.749
Maybe my mom and dad took care of it.

00:20:47.896 --> 00:20:50.249
Oh, it's coming up.

00:21:00.284 --> 00:21:02.983
What is this? Why is this...

00:21:04.572 --> 00:21:06.723
<i>Baby, you're the best.</i>

00:21:06.723 --> 00:21:08.048
Oh, no!

00:21:08.048 --> 00:21:09.488
What on earth is this?

00:21:09.488 --> 00:21:12.848
Wait, wait, this is...

00:21:12.848 --> 00:21:14.110
Wait! This...

00:21:14.110 --> 00:21:16.316
Wait, what is this?

00:21:17.812 --> 00:21:20.680
Why won't this turn off? Seriously!

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:22.652
Seriously! Oh, come on!

00:21:22.652 --> 00:21:24.352
How do I turn this off?

00:21:37.972 --> 00:21:39.672
No...

00:21:48.601 --> 00:21:51.284
Honey, it's really not what you think.

00:21:51.284 --> 00:21:53.583
It's really nothing, honey.

00:21:54.708 --> 00:21:57.572
It... was just sex.

00:21:57.572 --> 00:21:59.649
It was just curiosity.

00:22:00.276 --> 00:22:02.100
No, it was just a mistake.

00:22:02.100 --> 00:22:05.683
Yeah, it really was just a mistake, honey.

00:22:09.044 --> 00:22:10.510
Kyung Hee!

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:11.796
Kyung Hee, I was wrong.

00:22:11.796 --> 00:22:14.449
You know I love you only, Kyung Hee.

00:22:34.512 --> 00:22:36.649
H-Honey...

00:22:37.864 --> 00:22:39.780
"Honey"?

00:22:39.780 --> 00:22:42.256
Had enough fun, huh?

00:22:42.256 --> 00:22:44.783
You and I are strictly business from now on.

00:22:46.416 --> 00:22:48.116
Here it is.

00:22:51.044 --> 00:22:53.864
That car has been here for a while. Isn't it abandoned?

00:22:53.864 --> 00:22:55.349
Idiot, it's probably just parked there.

00:22:55.349 --> 00:22:57.960
No way. Who would park a car here?

00:22:57.960 --> 00:22:59.344
- If someone just abandoned that car, - I'm telling you.

00:22:59.344 --> 00:23:00.583
- I'll chop my own hand off. I mean it. - Awesome.

00:23:00.583 --> 00:23:04.380
Let's see. Come on. Your hand is gone today.

00:23:04.380 --> 00:23:07.296
- Looks nice, though. - Yeah, it is.

00:23:07.296 --> 00:23:08.952
- Come on, do it. Go on, just do it. - Oh, yeah.

00:23:08.952 --> 00:23:10.380
- Shoot, I'm opening it, okay? - No way there's anything in there.

00:23:10.380 --> 00:23:12.116
I'm opening it.

00:23:12.116 --> 00:23:13.716
- Shoot. - No way. Seriously?

00:23:13.716 --> 00:23:16.316
See, darn it! I told you it was in there! You punk!

00:23:16.316 --> 00:23:17.940
Wait.

00:23:17.940 --> 00:23:19.428
- Here it is! - There's a car key!

00:23:19.428 --> 00:23:22.316
- See? It was abandoned, right? - Shoot, there's a car key!

00:23:23.072 --> 00:23:27.516
- Let's step on it! - Step on it!

00:23:27.516 --> 00:23:30.149
Step on it!

00:23:30.149 --> 00:23:32.283
Shoot, it's so fast!

00:23:34.917 --> 00:23:36.782
Hey, watch the road!

00:23:37.483 --> 00:23:39.349
Jeez.

00:23:41.549 --> 00:23:43.516
It's so freaking nice, really.

00:23:43.516 --> 00:23:44.896
Isn't it awesome?

00:23:44.896 --> 00:23:46.676
- Hey, hey, hey! - What? Why?

00:23:46.676 --> 00:23:48.816
Darn it, the cops are following us.

00:23:48.816 --> 00:23:51.128
Crap, it's the cops.

00:23:51.128 --> 00:23:52.916
I told you this car was suspicious.

00:23:52.916 --> 00:23:55.112
It's because you turned the music up so freaking loud!

00:23:55.112 --> 00:23:56.852
Is that what's important right now? I told you we should ditch this car.

00:23:56.852 --> 00:24:00.068
Stop arguing and just pull over. Just stop the car.

00:24:00.068 --> 00:24:03.316
- Pull over, pull over, hurry! - I'll pull over then.

00:24:08.472 --> 00:24:10.376
- Detective. - Yeah?

00:24:10.376 --> 00:24:13.108
I'm serious, the car keys were right there in the car.

00:24:13.108 --> 00:24:15.264
- The keys were in there? - Yeah.

00:24:15.264 --> 00:24:17.628
And the headlights were already broken.

00:24:17.628 --> 00:24:18.720
So were the bumper and grille.

00:24:18.720 --> 00:24:19.960
Yeah, and,

00:24:19.960 --> 00:24:22.190
When we looked closely, the car was pretty beat-up,

00:24:22.190 --> 00:24:24.310
And it had this ugly brownish color.

00:24:24.310 --> 00:24:27.132
So naturally, we figured someone had abandoned it, so we took it for a spin.

00:24:27.132 --> 00:24:29.149
- That's true. - Yeah.

00:24:32.808 --> 00:24:34.688
- Detective. - Yeah?

00:24:34.688 --> 00:24:38.292
Do you think someone ditched the car after an accident to avoid getting caught?

00:24:38.292 --> 00:24:40.616
Exactly, why would someone abandon such a darn expensive car?

00:24:40.616 --> 00:24:42.368
- See? I told you something was weird. - That's right.

00:24:42.368 --> 00:24:43.924
Yeah, that's right. What if this punk actually killed someone?

00:24:43.924 --> 00:24:46.916
Hey! Sit down.

00:24:48.596 --> 00:24:52.154
I'm telling you, this punk killed someone.

00:24:52.154 --> 00:24:56.544
- He needs to be freaking punished. - Let's keep it down.

00:24:56.544 --> 00:24:57.976
- Okay? - Yes.

00:24:57.976 --> 00:24:59.816
Yes.

00:24:59.816 --> 00:25:02.380
So you're saying the headlights were already broken?

00:25:02.380 --> 00:25:04.116
Yes.

00:25:51.220 --> 00:25:53.649
Min Seo!

00:25:59.012 --> 00:26:03.480
Min Seo, you're using protection properly, right?

00:26:03.480 --> 00:26:08.588
I just think it's all curiosity.

00:26:08.588 --> 00:26:11.049
It's just a phase.

00:26:11.049 --> 00:26:14.640
But does he really love you?

00:26:14.640 --> 00:26:17.016
Huh? Can you really trust him?

00:26:17.644 --> 00:26:21.248
Men are all the same,

00:26:21.248 --> 00:26:23.649
And love is...

00:26:23.649 --> 00:26:26.512
- meaningless. - How much did you drink?

00:26:26.512 --> 00:26:28.583
It's true.

00:26:29.440 --> 00:26:31.583
Min Seo...

00:26:33.572 --> 00:26:35.716
Seriously...

00:26:38.316 --> 00:26:41.483
Do you still go to your dad's place?

00:26:42.568 --> 00:26:46.649
You can't leave me, Min Seo.

00:26:47.392 --> 00:26:52.780
You're all I have now, okay?

00:26:52.780 --> 00:26:58.084
I'll do whatever it takes to make sure none of this hurts you.

00:26:58.084 --> 00:27:02.480
I-I'll find a way.

00:27:02.480 --> 00:27:04.549
Min Seo, I love you!

00:27:04.549 --> 00:27:06.649
What is she saying, really?

00:27:22.080 --> 00:27:24.816
Dad, why are you here?

00:27:29.120 --> 00:27:31.249
Oh, Ye... Ye Ji.

00:28:15.448 --> 00:28:18.064
I'll do it, Dad, just sit down.

00:28:18.064 --> 00:28:20.949
No, Ye Ji. I need to do this.

00:28:46.893 --> 00:28:48.593
Lim Ye Ji.

00:28:50.392 --> 00:28:52.452
Yeah, Mom.

00:28:52.452 --> 00:28:56.783
Does Min Seo like you in the same way too?

00:29:00.112 --> 00:29:04.483
Then why did she make you take the blame for what she did?

00:29:09.988 --> 00:29:11.983
Answer her, Ye Ji.

00:29:12.684 --> 00:29:14.424
Even after promising to love you forever,

00:29:14.424 --> 00:29:17.064
Promising to protect you until your hair turns gray,

00:29:17.064 --> 00:29:19.383
People can still stab you in the back.

00:29:21.336 --> 00:29:23.900
Right, Ye Ji, just like your mom says,

00:29:23.900 --> 00:29:26.688
- you two should break up quickly-- - So,

00:29:28.072 --> 00:29:31.016
You should stick together even more when things get tough, okay?

00:29:31.764 --> 00:29:34.216
You went so far as to cover for her,

00:29:34.928 --> 00:29:38.049
So it'd be unfair for her to betray you now.

00:29:39.320 --> 00:29:43.416
Do you understand what I mean?

00:29:45.648 --> 00:29:48.640
That's right, Ye Ji, don't break up with her.

00:29:48.640 --> 00:29:52.516
You should stick together even more when things get tough, okay?

00:29:53.360 --> 00:29:56.580
From now on, our family should use this as a chance.

00:29:56.580 --> 00:29:58.548
Okay? Ye Ji.

00:29:58.548 --> 00:30:01.516
I'll really do my best

00:30:02.172 --> 00:30:04.383
To make our family stronger, honey.

00:30:06.948 --> 00:30:08.810
Husband and child, what's gotten into them?

00:30:08.810 --> 00:30:11.149
Are they possessed by the women next door?

00:30:14.552 --> 00:30:17.249
Huh? Oh, I'm getting a call, honey.

00:30:18.164 --> 00:30:20.272
An unknown number.

00:30:20.272 --> 00:30:23.249
I should take this. Be right back.

00:30:26.060 --> 00:30:28.016
Hello, this is Cha Eun Bin.

00:30:29.564 --> 00:30:32.316
Oh, this is Lim Jae Hong.

00:30:33.332 --> 00:30:35.183
The police station?

00:30:46.900 --> 00:30:49.736
Are you really not going to press charges?

00:30:49.736 --> 00:30:52.922
No. I just want to settle this quietly.

00:30:52.922 --> 00:30:55.416
Come on, just go inside already!

00:30:55.416 --> 00:30:56.416
Let's go inside and talk.

00:30:56.416 --> 00:31:00.432
They're repeat offenders. Forgiveness isn't going to change them.

00:31:00.432 --> 00:31:03.992
They caused the whole mess and then lied about it.

00:31:03.992 --> 00:31:07.752
People like that need to be hit with a massive repair bill.

00:31:07.752 --> 00:31:10.444
Though I doubt even that would teach them a lesson.

00:31:10.444 --> 00:31:12.324
Oh, but still,

00:31:12.324 --> 00:31:15.049
They seem pretty young.

00:31:16.164 --> 00:31:19.549
When you live life, mistakes are bound to happen.

00:31:20.356 --> 00:31:23.840
So shouldn't we give them another chance?

00:31:23.840 --> 00:31:25.983
Yes, I suppose you're right.

00:31:28.024 --> 00:31:30.424
[Yongnam Police Station] Honey, I handled it well.

00:31:30.424 --> 00:31:31.924
<i>- Are you sure?</i> - Yeah.

00:31:31.924 --> 00:31:33.900
<i>You didn't get nervous and give anything away, did you?</i>

00:31:33.900 --> 00:31:37.149
What? Me, nervous?

00:31:38.584 --> 00:31:41.540
Well, I was a little nervous at first,

00:31:41.540 --> 00:31:44.332
But I really got into character, you know?

00:31:44.332 --> 00:31:47.692
I really sold it, and the detective bought it right away.

00:31:47.692 --> 00:31:49.880
<i>- Really?</i> - Yeah.

00:31:49.880 --> 00:31:54.649
Plus, apparently those punks have a long record of similar offenses.

00:31:54.649 --> 00:31:56.064
<i>- A criminal record?</i> - Yeah.

00:31:56.064 --> 00:31:57.532
<i>- So it's all taken care of?</i> - Yeah.

00:31:57.532 --> 00:31:59.416
<i>- I'm hanging up.</i> - Huh?

00:32:17.291 --> 00:32:20.152
Oh, Sol, it's been a while.

00:32:20.152 --> 00:32:23.783
- Darn it. - Forget it, forget it!

00:32:25.664 --> 00:32:28.283
Why can't I win?

00:32:30.781 --> 00:32:33.824
Well, take a seat.

00:32:33.824 --> 00:32:36.349
Has Sol been here?

00:32:37.580 --> 00:32:41.316
You're Do? Oh, it's you.

00:32:42.012 --> 00:32:45.508
After all that mess that day,

00:32:45.508 --> 00:32:49.249
Na Sol hasn't been anywhere near here since.

00:32:51.596 --> 00:32:53.883
Give me a call if Na Sol shows up.

00:32:53.883 --> 00:32:56.283
Yes, understood.

00:33:00.196 --> 00:33:01.696
What's wrong?

00:33:01.696 --> 00:33:03.516
W-What is it?

00:33:05.096 --> 00:33:06.816
You don't even have my number.

00:33:06.816 --> 00:33:08.808
- Oh, right. - Give me a call.

00:33:08.808 --> 00:33:11.864
Yes, take care.

00:33:11.864 --> 00:33:14.868
<i>I searched through every branch nationwide to find this.</i>

00:33:14.868 --> 00:33:18.249
<i>For the details, you'll have to do some legwork yourself.</i>

00:33:18.249 --> 00:33:19.983
Yeah, sir, the thing is,

00:33:19.983 --> 00:33:23.204
I'm urgently looking for an accident vehicle.

00:33:23.204 --> 00:33:28.264
So could I ask you about the condition of this car?

00:33:28.264 --> 00:33:30.249
- This car? - Yeah.

00:33:31.483 --> 00:33:33.983
This car...

00:33:35.783 --> 00:33:40.549
Looks like this car just has an internal mechanical issue and is being repaired.

00:33:41.484 --> 00:33:45.648
Was there any damage to the front, like anything cracked or broken?

00:33:45.648 --> 00:33:50.083
No, this one just needs a simple fan belt replacement.

00:33:54.180 --> 00:33:56.983
Sir, I'm really in a hurry.

00:34:02.216 --> 00:34:05.649
[Imported Car Repair, First-Class Cheongnam Motors]

00:34:05.649 --> 00:34:07.683
[The go-to shop for domestic SUV repairs]

00:34:07.683 --> 00:34:10.883
[The true repair hub for the Rich Gold Limited Edition domestic SUV]

00:34:10.883 --> 00:34:13.728
[The repair haven for Rich Gold Limited Edition owners]

00:34:16.310 --> 00:34:19.316
What? Why are they all so far away?

00:34:19.316 --> 00:34:21.446
[1. CN First Motors, Unpyeong-si, Gyeonggi Province]

00:34:21.446 --> 00:34:22.816
[2. Cheongnam Motors, Cheongnam-si, Gyeonggi Province]

00:34:28.283 --> 00:34:31.212
[Notice of Clinic Closure, Director's Morning Off]

00:34:31.212 --> 00:34:32.516
Hello.

00:34:32.516 --> 00:34:35.760
- Today, our director... - The director is off today?

00:34:35.760 --> 00:34:37.052
All of a sudden?

00:34:37.052 --> 00:34:39.180
You should've let me know ahead of time.

00:34:39.180 --> 00:34:40.502
I'm sorry.

00:34:40.502 --> 00:34:43.616
A seminar came up unexpectedly.

00:34:44.388 --> 00:34:48.434
If you don't mind, can we have another doctor assist you?

00:34:48.434 --> 00:34:50.679
Forget it, I'll come back another time.

00:34:50.679 --> 00:34:52.812
- Jeez. - I'm sorry.

00:34:52.812 --> 00:34:55.016
Take care.

00:35:16.816 --> 00:35:18.380
The embezzlement investigation is already underway.

00:35:18.380 --> 00:35:20.276
What are you going to do?

00:35:20.276 --> 00:35:21.968
Huh?

00:35:21.968 --> 00:35:26.616
Where the on earth did you spend 300 million won?

00:35:27.324 --> 00:35:31.583
I need to know what happened if we're to get our stories straight.

00:35:32.274 --> 00:35:33.974
Captain Park!

00:35:34.700 --> 00:35:37.304
What's really going on?

00:35:37.304 --> 00:35:39.004
Well...

00:35:40.252 --> 00:35:44.872
No, I'll give it back within a few days.

00:35:44.872 --> 00:35:48.549
I'll give it back so quickly no one will even know it was missing.

00:35:53.836 --> 00:35:56.249
Oh, what do I do?

00:35:56.249 --> 00:35:59.416
What am I going to do?

00:35:59.416 --> 00:36:01.116
Seriously...

00:36:03.644 --> 00:36:06.083
Are you okay? Oh, I'm sorry.

00:36:06.820 --> 00:36:10.083
Why would they put a speed bump here where there's no one around?

00:36:10.083 --> 00:36:11.983
I really...

00:36:14.649 --> 00:36:17.716
What am I going to do?

00:36:35.540 --> 00:36:37.684
How does that even make sense?

00:36:37.684 --> 00:36:40.249
If they find out, it'll be embezzlement.

00:36:43.804 --> 00:36:46.018
Oh.

00:36:46.018 --> 00:36:47.983
Oh, yes, Director.

00:36:48.592 --> 00:36:50.292
Yes.

00:36:51.272 --> 00:36:53.384
Oh, yeah, the thing is,

00:36:53.384 --> 00:36:56.412
Today's our first meeting, right?

00:36:56.412 --> 00:37:00.949
I think the staff might need a sugar boost right now.

00:37:01.756 --> 00:37:03.332
Yes.

00:37:03.332 --> 00:37:06.584
And since I arrived a little early,

00:37:06.584 --> 00:37:08.140
Would it be okay if I went upstairs first?

00:37:08.140 --> 00:37:10.449
[No Eating in the Office] Oh, of course, Director.

00:37:23.024 --> 00:37:25.449
Darn it.

00:37:32.932 --> 00:37:37.983
I came to wrap things up quickly over what happened yesterday.

00:37:42.976 --> 00:37:46.160
Here, 151 million won.

00:37:46.160 --> 00:37:48.416
How dare you come here.

00:37:54.352 --> 00:37:56.649
Ms. Park, I...

00:38:12.276 --> 00:38:14.384
Oh no, I...

00:38:14.384 --> 00:38:17.246
I'm so sorry.

00:38:17.246 --> 00:38:18.846
I won't make excuses, and I...

00:38:18.846 --> 00:38:21.900
I don't even know what I was thinking.

00:38:21.900 --> 00:38:24.883
It was really, truly just a mistake,

00:38:24.883 --> 00:38:28.483
And I'll never, ever see him again.

00:38:33.892 --> 00:38:37.328
With everything involving Ye Ji and Min Seo,

00:38:37.328 --> 00:38:39.028
I mean,

00:38:39.652 --> 00:38:42.949
Including that video, let's just...

00:38:42.949 --> 00:38:46.349
Let's pretend it never happened, and we...

00:38:46.349 --> 00:38:48.049
No!

00:38:50.108 --> 00:38:54.049
Get out, now, if you don't want to be utterly humiliated.

00:39:03.588 --> 00:39:05.464
Jeez.

00:39:05.464 --> 00:39:07.783
This is driving me crazy.

00:39:21.336 --> 00:39:23.483
Wow, you even signed everything for us.

00:39:23.483 --> 00:39:25.560
- That's nothing. - Thank you, thank you.

00:39:25.560 --> 00:39:28.092
By the way, I really enjoy it.

00:39:28.092 --> 00:39:29.683
- That Model House. - Oh, that.

00:39:29.683 --> 00:39:31.346
- It's pretty good. - Yes.

00:39:31.346 --> 00:39:32.784
It's Townhouse.

00:39:32.784 --> 00:39:35.320
Well, model or town, they're basically the same thing.

00:39:35.320 --> 00:39:36.898
A house is a house, right?

00:39:36.898 --> 00:39:37.973
Right.

00:39:37.973 --> 00:39:40.092
By the way, you're handsome.

00:39:40.092 --> 00:39:43.016
Yeah right, how long will the repairs take?

00:39:43.016 --> 00:39:45.660
I'll get it done as soon as possible and let you know as soon as I can.

00:39:45.660 --> 00:39:47.456
Okay, got it.

00:39:47.456 --> 00:39:49.156
- Well, I'll get going, then. - Yes.

00:39:49.156 --> 00:39:50.752
- My taxi is here. - Oh, I see.

00:39:50.752 --> 00:39:52.116
Thank you. Please take care of it.

00:39:52.116 --> 00:39:54.408
- Take care! - Yeah.

00:39:54.408 --> 00:39:55.616
Wow!

00:39:55.616 --> 00:39:57.320
Who's that? A celebrity?

00:39:57.320 --> 00:39:58.972
- He's a celebrity. - Cha Eun Bin?

00:39:58.972 --> 00:40:00.916
- Yeah. - Wow, really.

00:40:00.916 --> 00:40:03.683
- Celebrities are different. - Did you see his face?

00:40:07.016 --> 00:40:14.849
[Min Seo's Mother]

00:40:14.849 --> 00:40:15.849
[Calling]

00:40:15.849 --> 00:40:21.883
[J's incoming call]

00:40:25.320 --> 00:40:28.849
Darn it, I really need to do a ritual or something.

00:40:34.183 --> 00:40:37.120
[J's incoming call]

00:40:45.088 --> 00:40:48.544
[J's incoming call]

00:40:55.304 --> 00:40:57.004
<i>Are you okay?</i>

00:41:02.172 --> 00:41:04.249
You must've been pretty shaken up yesterday, right?

00:41:05.076 --> 00:41:08.544
Your lover's currently passed out

00:41:08.544 --> 00:41:10.360
With her head in someone else's company toilet.

00:41:10.360 --> 00:41:12.183
<i>Come pick her up yourself.</i>

00:41:14.917 --> 00:41:18.249
The two of them are just completely nuts.

00:41:20.036 --> 00:41:22.883
I'm screwed, darn it.

00:41:27.124 --> 00:41:29.316
Darn it.

00:41:40.649 --> 00:41:42.112
[My Hong: It's all a misunderstanding. I really meant nothing.]

00:41:42.112 --> 00:41:43.392
[I didn't call to meet again. I called to get the money I mentioned yesterday.]

00:41:43.392 --> 00:41:44.576
[Please calm your anger, please!]

00:41:45.960 --> 00:41:47.449
Oh, have you been waiting long?

00:41:47.449 --> 00:41:49.888
- You're here, Kyung Hee? - Captain.

00:41:49.888 --> 00:41:51.049
Did you buy this, Director?

00:41:51.049 --> 00:41:53.049
Yes, go ahead and have some.

00:42:47.992 --> 00:42:50.056
We usually change them once a month.

00:42:50.056 --> 00:42:52.497
If you'd like, we can change them every two weeks.

00:42:52.497 --> 00:42:56.584
We can also select works mainly from artists you like.

00:42:56.584 --> 00:42:58.556
Your opinion would be the most accurate.

00:42:58.556 --> 00:43:00.449
Oh, my.

00:43:00.449 --> 00:43:01.816
You said you wanted paintings.

00:43:01.816 --> 00:43:03.916
I'll follow your opinion.

00:43:03.916 --> 00:43:05.972
Oh, my.

00:43:05.972 --> 00:43:07.672
Oh, excuse me.

00:43:14.718 --> 00:43:15.848
It's done.

00:43:15.848 --> 00:43:18.092
Director, do you have any plans afterward?

00:43:18.092 --> 00:43:21.549
Even if I did, I don't anymore.

00:43:21.549 --> 00:43:23.636
Then let me treat you to a meal.

00:43:23.636 --> 00:43:26.036
- Do you like eel by any chance? - Oh, eel...

00:43:26.036 --> 00:43:29.892
There's a place called Daewang Eel that I only take special guests to.

00:43:29.892 --> 00:43:31.491
It's really popular, so there's usually a long line.

00:43:31.491 --> 00:43:32.616
Then, let's go right now.

00:43:32.616 --> 00:43:33.900
They always give me a private room when I go.

00:43:33.900 --> 00:43:36.524
That sounds wonderful.

00:43:36.524 --> 00:43:38.583
Alright, then to the first floor.

00:43:39.924 --> 00:43:42.756
Come on, what a joke.

00:43:42.756 --> 00:43:45.983
Special, my foot. She's full of crap.

00:43:48.100 --> 00:43:49.800
Is anyone there?

00:43:54.188 --> 00:43:55.888
Excuse me.

00:44:09.904 --> 00:44:11.324
Jeez.

00:44:11.324 --> 00:44:14.072
Are you okay?

00:44:14.072 --> 00:44:15.772
Are you okay?

00:44:17.883 --> 00:44:20.816
- Don't come in! - I'm sorry.

00:44:25.192 --> 00:44:27.149
Oh, my!

00:44:31.264 --> 00:44:33.656
But are you really okay?

00:44:33.656 --> 00:44:36.160
Don't come any closer.

00:44:36.160 --> 00:44:40.083
I'll wait outside, then.

00:44:52.383 --> 00:44:55.916
[Vehicle Inspection & Repair Record, Owner: Lim Jae Hong]

00:44:57.208 --> 00:45:02.400
Sir, are you sure the owner is a man?

00:45:02.400 --> 00:45:03.564
Yes.

00:45:03.564 --> 00:45:05.427
You know that actor?

00:45:05.427 --> 00:45:06.524
The actor?

00:45:06.524 --> 00:45:09.644
The one who was in Townhouse or Model House.

00:45:09.644 --> 00:45:11.468
What was his name again?

00:45:11.468 --> 00:45:12.675
Oh, wait.

00:45:12.675 --> 00:45:15.508
I got his autograph right here. His name was Cha something.

00:45:15.508 --> 00:45:18.192
Oh, here it is.

00:45:18.192 --> 00:45:19.892
Cha Eun Bin!

